cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Wenn du dich auf dieses Werk beziehst, zitiere es bitte so. / If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "What Was There Before / Was vorher da war"
abstract: >-
  An interactive artwork that makes the writing process visible as a palimpsest:
  tempo, pauses, deletions, additions and the trail of the mouse are recorded in the
  browser and turned into a layered image and a navigable space of time.
  Source code: MIT License; website texts and images: CC BY 4.0.
authors:
